/Title (Top performing sellers drive the majority of Olist's marketplace revenue, following a classic Pareto distribution where approximately 20% of sellers generate 80% of total sales. Analysis reveals strong seller-revenue correlation, with high-performing sellers maintaining better ratings, faster delivery times, and broader product catalogs. Seller concentration remains a key marketplace dynamic to monitor for sustainable growth.)
